{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30358","headline":"送卢缄归扬州 · 赵嘏","name":"送卢缄归扬州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾向雷塘寄掩扉，荀家灯火有余辉。\n关河日暮望空极，杨柳渡头人独归。\n隋苑荒台风褭褭，灞陵残雨梦依依。\n今年春色还相悞，爲我江边谢钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}